---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContributionGraph from '../components/ContributionGraph.astro';
import { intro } from '../data/resume';
---

<Layout title="About — Isak Skoog" description="About Isak Skoog">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm {intro.age} and live in Gothenburg. I started programming around 13 with Python. At 16 I began an
      apprenticeship at UBS, which is where I started working in software professionally.
    </p>
    <p>
      I work as a quantitative software engineer at Silverbeard Engineering, on the data and execution backend of
      our trading systems, in Rust and Python. I also study computer science at the University of Gothenburg.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work I do some coding on the side and work out. After the apprenticeship I went back to Komvux to
      finish high school<sup><a href="#note-komvux">1</a></sup>.
    </p>
    <p id="note-komvux" class="note">
      <sup>1</sup> The Swedish university system didn't accept my apprenticeship as a high school diploma, so I
      took the missing courses at Komvux.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Contributions</h2>
    <ContributionGraph />
  </section>
</Layout>
